{"id":"n76033-1-11","stage":4,"title":"조형미 · 造形美","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76033-1-11-1","ko":"이 건물은 정말 너무 멋있다.","zh":"这栋楼真的太漂亮了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건물은","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋있다.","meaning":"帅气，优秀","explanation":"멋있다：帅气，优秀；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"帅气，优秀","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"很好或很出众。","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1b1952d38a296373760.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76033-1-11-2","ko":"응, 이런 건물이 있으니까 도시의 조형미도 살아나는 것 같네.","zh":"是啊，因为有这样的建筑，城市的景观美感似乎也更加出众了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건물이","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니까","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도시의","meaning":"都市，城市","explanation":"도시：都市，城市；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"도시","audio":"/audio/abbc940f03792a890e5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70743","senseId":"1","lemma":"도시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조형미도","meaning":"造形美","explanation":"조형미：造形美；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"조형미","audio":"/audio/c196529f7fb44df8efe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76033","senseId":"1","lemma":"조형미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살아나는","meaning":"复发，重振，再生","explanation":"살아나다：复发，重振，再生；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"살아나다","audio":"/audio/8512c4b0b7e23f0311e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16731","senseId":"5","lemma":"살아나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같네.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"abbc940f03792a89","term":"도시","zh":"都市，城市","audio":"/audio/abbc940f03792a890e5d.mp3","entryId":"70743","definition":"成为政治、经济和文化的中心，且人口大量居住的地区。","pronunciation":["도시"]},{"id":"c196529f7fb44df8","term":"조형미","zh":"造形美","audio":"/audio/c196529f7fb44df8efe8.mp3","entryId":"76033","definition":"立体化地塑造某个形象的艺术之美。","pronunciation":["조ː형미"]},{"id":"8512c4b0b7e23f03","term":"살아나다","zh":"复发，重振，再生","audio":"/audio/8512c4b0b7e23f0311e2.mp3","entryId":"16731","definition":"减弱了的气势或势力重新变强。","pronunciation":["사라나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/78b00dee93c2daa52265.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.897,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76033","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7237,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这栋楼真的太漂亮了。","是啊，因为有这样的建筑，城市的景观美感似乎也更加出众了。","门铃好像坏了。按了按钮却没有任何声音。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这栋楼真的太漂亮了。","是啊，因为有这样的建筑，城市的景观美感似乎也更加出众了。","门铃好像坏了。按了按钮却没有任何声音。"],"answer":1}]}
